178	```typescript
179	class ErrorLogManager {
180	    constructor(config: AppConfig)
181	
182	    append(entry: Omit<ErrorLogEntry, 'Id' | 'Timestamp'>): ErrorLogEntry
183	    list(options?: ErrorLogListOptions): ErrorLogListResult
184	    getById(id: number): ErrorLogEntry | undefined
185	    sources(): string[]  // sorted distinct Source values
186	    clear(): void
187	}
188	```
189	
190	> **No barrel index:** Import directly from the source files — `error-log.types.js` and `error-log.manager.js`. No `index.ts` exists for this module.
